        "# ===== EXPT 10 - PART A: ENVIRONMENT SETUP AND MODEL SELECTION =====\n",
        "# Name: <YOUR NAME>        Roll No: <YOUR ROLL NO>\n",
        "\n",
        "# 1. Install required libraries\n",
